# ~/.secrets — API keys and credentials. Copy this file to ~/.secrets and
# fill in real values, then `chmod 600 ~/.secrets`.
# NEVER commit real keys to this repo (it is public).
# Sourced by ~/.config/zsh/env.zsh for every zsh and bash (via BASH_ENV).

